# Google OAuth2 Client ID — required for Google Sheets sync
# Steps to create:
#   1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com
#   2. Create a project (or select an existing one)
#   3. Enable "Google Sheets API" in APIs & Services > Library
#   4. Go to APIs & Services > Credentials > Create Credentials > OAuth 2.0 Client ID
#   5. Application type: Web application
#   6. Add Authorized JavaScript origins: http://localhost:5173 (and your production domain)
#   7. Copy the Client ID below
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=650990151999-cgso12t633r3p2cu9mu849sfq6t6ppl3.apps.googleusercontent.com
